WEBVTT

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.670
It feels so good

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:10.330
to stop,

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:12.870
relax

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.210
and just be here.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:23.350
There's nothing I need to do right now.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.330
Nothing to achieve.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:34.840
And with this new level of relaxation a new

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:40.900
little wave of joy just came bubbling up from my belly

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:47.000
through my chest into my face I can feel the smile again

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:55.700
there's warmth in my face which feels really nice

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:00.360
still very subtle

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:07.010
And again I notice with my attention focusing in on the

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:13.490
smile and the face again some tension creeps into my experience

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:20.830
so I let my attention fall wide open again and relax just

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:24.430
sink back into more ease

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:32.260
And I just had a thought asking myself if

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:33.480
I was in jhana

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.060
relaxing my forehead

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:46.980
and just giving myself a little gratitude for letting

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.540
the thought go

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:50.750
And

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:54.810
I allow myself to just relax into this

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:58.590
almost letting go of the whole experience again

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:06.790
and with this letting go the energy just got more intense

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:17.470
now it almost feels as if I'm being pulled upward it's

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.550
quite joyful

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:26.490
makes it a little harder to speak

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:32.560
Now I can feel the joy like a ball of joy in

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:35.560
my heart in my chest

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:44.980
it almost feels as if it's a golden ball of joy that's

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:45.560
there

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:57.200
I'm a little bit surprised by that myself I didn't try to

00:02:57.220 --> 00:02:58.160
make that happen

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:11.960
but it's beautiful and I feel that I'm a little bit grasping

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:14.000
at it and

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:18.540
there's a little bit of tension in my torso now

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:26.180
so I let go of that golden ball in my chest completely

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.180
I just let it be and allow myself to relax

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:38.120
and that made the experience much sweeter

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:43.010
And there's a sense of peace that is opening up right now

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:47.290
it feels kind of spacious

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:52.890
also it feels fragile

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:08.250
and I notice that the part of my mind that is trying

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:13.750
to stabilize this piece is actually destabilizing it

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:23.360
It feels like there's this cloud of warm, soft,

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:28.340
kind peace in which these words are being spoken.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.320
It's beautiful.

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:40.870
A feeling that this love is always here and

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:42.130
it's boundless.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:49.760
There's a really delicious silence now and in that silence

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:51.780
as it

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:59.260
more and more filled the whole of my experience

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:06.360
there's this sense this very comforting sense that

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.480
nothing really matters

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:19.040
and that's not a cynical statement at all it's just

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:21.760
very very reassuring

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:30.550
And it's becoming harder and harder to find

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:31.670
words here.
